# Private test inputs that must never be published.
#
# Real captured device data (metered consumption, clock values) from the
# author's own installation. The published tests assert *relationships* over
# whatever is here and skip when the directory is empty, so a fresh clone
# still runs the full suite while this machine keeps the genuine regression
# data.
#
# Only .gitignore itself is tracked; everything else in here is ignored.
*
!.gitignore
